    {"label": "No internal contradictions between figures", "passed": true|false, "note": "<one sentence>"}
  ],
  "findings": [
    {"severity": "high|low", "where": "<section or quote fragment>", "issue": "<the untraceable or unattributed figure and why it fails>", "fix": "<the exact corrected wording, or 'remove'>"}
  ]
}

findings must be empty when everything passes. Never invent problems to look diligent — a clean pass is a legitimate result.
